# <app> - runtime environment.
#
# The template ships no env reader; these are the runtime variables the
# product consumes once the config resolver is wired (PLAYBOOK_CLI.md section
# 4.2). Copy to .env and uncomment what you need.
#
# Never put a secret here: the auth token lives in the OS keystore, not in an
# env file or the shell history (PLAYBOOK_SECURITY.md).
# <APP>_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# <APP>_PROFILE=default
